  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="261435e3-e8a4-56a1-9a59-faa53436b9d3" activityNameId="81e70a24-6887-5645-a9cf-03b7b3d4a596" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Van &lt;3.5t</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Van &lt;3.5t
The values refer to the production of one average van. Environmental interventions in the vehicle production are derived from the production of the Golf A4.;
UUID: 9e0da2a4-f34c-3525-bdef-e4ec5d1e88d1
The inventory includes  processes of  material, energy and water use in vehicle manufacturing. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for. Plant infrastructure is included, addressing issues such as land use, building, road and parking construction.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Current production technology, environmental issues have been addressed in the past.
Time period: The material consumption reflect a modern vehicle. For vehicle manufacturing data for the manufacturing of a passenger car has been employed as an first estimate. 
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data for material consumption is based on expert estimates. Manufacturing data is based on an LCI study of one passenger car. 
Extrapolations: Production data for one German passenger car type is used as an first estimate for Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e0da2a4-f34c-3525-bdef-e4ec5d1e88d1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
